      "rule": "pairwise ranking loss, dropping pairs where BOTH members are at the detection limit",
      "why": "A floored pair carries no ordering information and would teach the model a false tie-break. A floored-versus-live pair carries the real signal that one variant is dead. Excluding censored variants entirely would discard that, and regressing on them would assert a precise value the assay never measured.",
